# No Origins: one repository for the code: noi, ui and infrastructure (8 Nov).
# Each folder's own .gitignore still applies: noi keeps its secrets, target and vendor out,
# infrastructure/supabase its backups.

# This Mac
.DS_Store
.pnpm-store/

# Secrets, wherever they are: database logins, this Mac's vouch key, local settings
*.local.env
*.local.pem
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Built or downloaded, never written by hand
node_modules/
.next/
noi/target/
noi/vendor/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Planning (notes, decisions, design pages) is a separate, private repository.
# On the maintainer's machine it sits in this folder; it is never tracked here.
/Planning/
